msgid "Usage: click [OPTION]... [BUTTONS]...\nClick mouse buttons.\n\nOptions:\n  -r, --repeat=N             Repeat entire sequence N times\n  -D, --next-delay=N         Delay N milliseconds between input events (up/down,                                a complete click means doubled time)\n  -P, --press-release        Press & release mouse button to complete a click, (optional)\n  -h, --help                 Display this help and exit\n\nHow to specify buttons:\n  Now all mouse buttons are represented using hexadecimal numeric values, with an optional\nbit mask to specify if mouse up/down needs to be omitted.\n  0x00 - LEFT\n  0x01 - RIGHT\n  0x02 - MIDDLE\n  0x03 - SIDE\n  0x04 - EXTR\n  0x05 - FORWARD\n  0x06 - BACK\n  0x07 - TASK\n  0x40 - Mouse down\n  0x80 - Mouse up\n  Examples:\n    0x00: chooses left button, but does nothing (you can use this to implement extra sleeps)\n    0xC0: left button click (down then up)\n    0x41: right button down\n    0x82: middle button up\n  The '0x' prefix can be omitted if you want.\n"
msgstr "PENGGUNAAN: click [OPTION]... [BUTTONS]...\nKlik tombol mouse.\n\nOptions:\n  -r, --repeat=N             Ulangi seluruh urutan sebanyak N kali\n  -D, --next-delay=N         Jeda N milidetik di antara peristiwa input (tekan/lepas,                                satu klik penuh berarti waktu dua kali lipat)\n  -P, --press-release        Tekan lalu lepaskan tombol mouse untuk menyelesaikan klik (opsional)\n  -h, --help                 Tampilkan bantuan ini lalu keluar\n\nCara menentukan tombol:\n  Kini semua tombol mouse dinyatakan dengan nilai numerik heksadesimal, dengan\nbit mask opsional untuk menentukan apakah mouse up/down perlu dihilangkan.\n  0x00 - LEFT\n  0x01 - RIGHT\n  0x02 - MIDDLE\n  0x03 - SIDE\n  0x04 - EXTR\n  0x05 - FORWARD\n  0x06 - BACK\n  0x07 - TASK\n  0x40 - Mouse ditekan\n  0x80 - Mouse dilepas\n  Examples:\n    0x00: memilih tombol kiri, tetapi tidak melakukan apa pun (dapat digunakan untuk menambahkan jeda)\n    0xC0: klik tombol kiri (tekan lalu lepas)\n    0x41: tombol kanan ditekan\n    0x82: tombol tengah dilepas\n  Awalan '0x' boleh dihilangkan jika diinginkan.\n"

